Approved slice (verbatim):
S2 — skill lines. Add two exported helpers to `src/skills.ts`: `parseSkillLine(line)` returns `{ name, args }` for a line starting with `/skill:` and `null` otherwise; `relaySkillLine(line, send)` calls `send` with the parsed skill and returns whether it did. Both are required exports of this PR, tested in `tests/skills.test.ts`.

